{
  "file" : "npc/re/merchants/enchan_edda_half_moon.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 17,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 18,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "placeholders" : [
        "getitemname(28387)",
        "getitemname(25088)"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If you have 1 ^0000cd{0}^000000 and a ^0000cd{1}^000000, I will grant you the power of the Goddess.",
      "translation" : "只要您有1个^0000cd{0}^000000和1个^0000cd{1}^000000，我就能赐予您女神的力量。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 20,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 21,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'll do a good job. Leave it to me.",
      "translation" : "放心交给我，保证办得妥妥当当。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 23,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What is a Goddess' power?",
      "translation" : "女神的力量是什么？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 23,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Well then, please.",
      "translation" : "那就拜托了"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 23,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It's nothing.",
      "translation" : "没什么"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 25,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 26,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What is the power of a Goddess? Did you just ask about the power of the Goddess?",
      "translation" : "女神的力量是什么？您刚才问的是女神的力量吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 28,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No.",
      "translation" : "不"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 28,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yes. I asked.",
      "translation" : "是，我问的"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 29,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 30,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'd like to talk to you, please listen.",
      "translation" : "我想和您谈谈，请听我说。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 33,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Power of the Goddess!!! I love the Goddess! Goddess, you're awesome!!!",
      "translation" : "女神的力量！！！我爱女神！女神，您太棒了！！！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There's a story that needs to be told first.",
      "translation" : "这得先从一段往事说起。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I've always been a fan of the ^0000cdGoddess^000000. As I entered the temple and started my life as a devoted follower, my life began to blossom.",
      "translation" : "我一直仰慕着^0000cd女神^000000。进入神殿成为虔诚的信徒后，我的人生便焕发了光彩。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "One day before I went to sleep, I had a ^0000cddream^000000 while I way praying to the Goddess.",
      "translation" : "有一天临睡前，我向女神祈祷时做了一个^0000cd梦^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I heard the ^0000cdvoice^000000 of Goddess Freya in the full light.",
      "translation" : "在明亮的光芒中，我听到了女神芙蕾雅的^0000cd声音^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "But unfortunately, as soon as I woke up, I forgot all about my dream. That's how dreams are.",
      "translation" : "可惜一醒来，我就把梦忘得一干二净。梦总是这样啊。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I cried endlessly because I felt sorry for that fact. But if the Goddess lets me hear her voice through a dream, wouldn't we too, be able to reach the Goddess through dreaming?",
      "translation" : "我为此伤心得哭个不停。不过，既然女神能在梦中向我传达声音，我们是不是也能通过梦境与女神沟通呢？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I started to study dreams with all my passion. I thought this was the will of the Goddess, who's trying to convey to me through them.",
      "translation" : "于是，我满怀热情地研究起梦境。我想，这一定是女神借梦境传达给我的旨意。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 58,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "While I was working hard on my research, I made the ^0000cdPassage of Dreams^000000 at the request of our aunt, High Priestess Niren, who's right next to me. It's the result of what I dedicated my life to.",
      "translation" : "潜心研究期间，我应身旁这位尼伦阿姨，也就是大祭司的请求，造出了^0000cd梦境通道^000000。那是我毕生心血的结晶。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I can't reach the Goddess yet... But there aren't many people who encounter the Goddess in their dreams... Like me...",
      "translation" : "虽然还无法真正与女神沟通...但像我这样能在梦中见到女神的人...可没几个..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Anyway, when I first heard the request from our aunt, High Priestess Niren, I was surprised.",
      "translation" : "总之，尼伦阿姨第一次向我提出这个请求时，我可是吓了一跳。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Would you dare to enter the Pope's dream...? The High Priestess Niren convinced me to enter her dream, but there was nothing that I could do to help her.",
      "translation" : "竟然要进入教皇的梦境...谁敢这么做啊？后来尼伦大祭司说服了我，可当时我也实在帮不上她的忙。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "And the persuasion was surprisingly convincing.",
      "translation" : "不过，她那番话还真把我说服了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 72,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[{0}]",
      "translation" : "[{0}]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So what's the Power of the Goddess?",
      "translation" : "那么，女神的力量究竟是什么？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "When I first entered the Pope's dream, I was amazed.",
      "translation" : "当我第一次进入教皇的梦境时，我惊呆了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[{0}]",
      "translation" : "[{0}]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Why?",
      "translation" : "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Of my ^0000cdgenius^000000.",
      "translation" : "因为我实在是个^0000cd天才^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Can anyone else in the world create a device that allows them to enter other people's dreams and experience them vividly? Kya- After all, Goddess' beloved lamb.",
      "translation" : "这世上还有谁能造出这样的装置，让人进入他人的梦境并身临其境地体验一切？呀——不愧是女神钟爱的羔羊！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 89,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "As I was walking through the Pope's dream, I accidentally found a ^0000cdPriest's Necklace^000000 from the priest and a special energetic ^0000cdFragment^000000 from the faceless shrine there.",
      "translation" : "探索教皇的梦境时，我偶然从牧师那里得到了一枚^0000cd牧师项链^000000，还在无面神龛那里找到一块蕴含特殊能量的^0000cd碎片^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 92,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "And I went around trying to find out as much as I could in my dreams, but when the Pope found me, she rejected me fiercely in fear.",
      "translation" : "我在梦里四处探索，想尽量多了解一些。可教皇一发现我，就吓得拼命排斥我。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm not the Pope's closest confidant, so I must have been just a stranger to her.",
      "translation" : "我并非教皇最亲密的知己，对她来说，我大概只是个陌生人吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So I was thrown out of the Pope's dream.",
      "translation" : "于是，我被赶出了教皇的梦境。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 102,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "By the way. When I woke up from my dream, I had the Priest's Necklace from the shrine and the strange fragment still in my hands. What do you think?",
      "translation" : "对了，醒来时，神龛里得到的牧师项链和那块奇怪的碎片竟然还在我手里。您觉得呢？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 104,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[{0}]",
      "translation" : "[{0}]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 105,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Amazing.",
      "translation" : "太不可思议了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh Goddess, please pity the blunt sensibility of an adventurer who can express these tremendous results in a word that is just amazing-",
      "translation" : "噢，女神啊，请怜悯这位感觉迟钝的冒险者吧！如此惊人的成果，竟然只会用“不可思议”来形容..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 112,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I was able to bring out the things I got from other people's dreams. This is a big deal! Let's get down to business because you don't seem to empathize.",
      "translation" : "我居然能把从别人梦里得到的东西带出来！这可是了不起的发现！看来您没什么共鸣，我们还是言归正传吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I began to study the necklace and the strange fragment of the shrine. The strange fragment was named the ^0000cdDream Fragment^000000, meaning the fragment obtained in a dream. Kyah- Name Sense!",
      "translation" : "我开始研究项链和神龛里的奇怪碎片，并把碎片命名为^0000cd梦之碎片^000000，也就是从梦中得到的碎片。呀——这名字起得真妙！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 118,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "They seemed normal when being separated, however I felt a subtle energy when I stacked them on top of each other.",
      "translation" : "它们分开时看起来都很普通，但叠放在一起时，我感到了一股微妙的能量。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "From then on, I entered the Pope's dream and began to study by collecting them one by one, without being noticed by the Pope.",
      "translation" : "从那以后，我便偷偷进入教皇的梦境，避开她的注意，一点点收集材料进行研究。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 124,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I discovered that by collecting about ^0000cd100 Dream Fragments^000000, compressing them with force, and putting them into the ^0000cdPriest's Necklace^000000, I can grant it ^0000cdspecial powers^000000.",
      "translation" : "后来我发现，只要收集大约^0000cd100个梦之碎片^000000，用力压缩后放入^0000cd牧师项链^000000，就能赋予项链^0000cd特殊力量^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 127,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
      "translation" : "[神殿物品管理员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 128,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "And by continuously researching and researching, I've succeeded in separating that power into three degrees.",
      "translation" : "经过反复研究，我终于把这股力量分成了三个等级。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Temple Item Manager",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Temple Item Manager]",
